<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Argentine consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in May, the Economy Ministry said:</p>
<p>    Food				     0.0</p>
<p>    Clothing				 0.0</p>
<p>    Housing				 -0.3</p>
<p>    Household goods		     -0.1</p>
<p>    Health				   0.0</p>
<p>    Transport and communications    -0.1</p>
<p>    Entertainment			 -0.3</p>
<p>    Education				0.0</p>
<p>    Others				  -0.1</p>
<p>    Total				   -0.1</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
